# Fire Lord Zuko: "whenever a permanent you control enters from exile, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control." (CR 603.2, 400.7)
# Ephemerate flickers Bot1's Memnite: it returns from exile as a new object and both it and Zuko get a counter (Zuko 3/5, Memnite 2/2).
# On turn 2 Bot2 flickers its own Memnite with Ephemerate: it enters from exile under Bot2, so Zuko's controller gets nothing.

